  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Liu Liu Liu appears behind Duke Long during Longevity Heaven’s assault on Heavenly Court. The grey light dagger in his hand thrusts into Duke Long’s back. Even the purple-gold dragon scales cannot block it.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_liu_liu",
        "char_duke_long",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the previous life, Liu Liu Liu had killed many members of Heavenly Court with this move, and even severely injured Fairy Zi Wei. At that time, if not for Wu Shuang blocking most of the power, Fairy Zi Wei would have died in his hands. Northern Plains immortals are energized: this is the first time since the start of the war that Duke Long is wounded like this.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The dagger pierces Duke Long’s body but sticks as if in a block of iron, unable to move an inch. Duke Long slowly turns, names it a human path killer move, and says it fits Liu Liu Liu’s temperament. He grasps Liu Liu Liu’s head. Liu Liu Liu realizes Duke Long took the hit on purpose and used his body as bait. Like the dagger, Liu Liu Liu cannot move. Duke Long crushes his skull. The headless corpse falls, and the grey dagger dissipates at once.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The grey light dagger can thrust through Duke Long’s purple-gold dragon scales. When Liu Liu Liu dies, the grey dagger dissipates instantly.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
